 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 11416,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"333\">To recognize binary strings ending in &lsquo;01&rsquo;, we can define a DFA with 3 states:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"428\">\n\t<li data-end=\"447\" data-start=\"428\">\n\t<p data-end=\"447\" data-start=\"430\">q0: Start state</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"448\">\n\t<p data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"450\">q1: After seeing &lsquo;0&rsquo;</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"473\">\n\t<p data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"475\">q2: After seeing &lsquo;01&rsquo; (accepting state)</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"518\"><strong data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"518\">DFA:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"529\">\n\t<li data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"529\">\n\t<p data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"531\">&delta;(q0, 0) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"547\">\n\t<p data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"549\">&delta;(q0, 1) = q0</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"565\">\n\t<p data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"567\">&delta;(q1, 0) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"583\">\n\t<p data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"585\">&delta;(q1, 1) = q2</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"601\">\n\t<p data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"603\">&delta;(q2, 0) = q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"619\">\n\t<p data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"621\">&delta;(q2, 1) = q0</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"638\"><strong data-end=\"645\" data-start=\"638\">NFA</strong> can be simpler:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"664\">\n\t<li data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"664\">\n\t<p data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"666\">Start at q0</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"680\">\n\t<p data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"682\">On 0, move to q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"701\">\n\t<p data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"703\">On 1 from q1, move to q2 (final)</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"737\"><strong data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"737\">NFA Transitions:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"760\">\n\t<li data-end=\"775\" data-start=\"760\">\n\t<p data-end=\"775\" data-start=\"762\">q0 &rarr; 0 &rarr; q1</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"776\">\n\t<p data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"778\">q1 &rarr; 1 &rarr; q2</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"793\">This demonstrates both automata modeling the same language.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 3,
